Package: assignmentB2JeremyDykstra
Title: Counting Missing Values for Columns by Group
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Jeremy", "Dykstra", , "jdykst01@student.ubc.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package is useful for counting missing values for various groups. 
  There are two main features of this package, both focused on producing a tibble output table with missing values. 
  The first feature is to create an ungrouped missing values table for different columns. 
  The second feature is to also display missing values, grouped by a specified variable in the output table.
